    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i>\u00a0Prologue and turn a small, run-down shop into the bar of your dreams. Serve amazing drinks, keep your guests happy, and grow your business with smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1754655239\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.mp4?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is the key to attracting customers. Use your initial budget wisely to get basic supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1754655239\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.webm?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.mp4?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR MENU AND MASTER YOUR CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock new ingredients, master recipes, and create drinks your guests will love. Experiment, develop your style, and make your mark on the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.poster.avif?t=1754655239\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.webm?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.mp4?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCE IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful pub is about more than just pouring drinks. Manage your stock, control expenses, and respond to customer demands. Make smart investments or risk putting your business in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.poster.avif?t=1754655239\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.webm?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.mp4?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN IMMERSIVE PUB MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its deep management system, evolving gameplay, and realistic pub-building mechanics, <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i>\u00a0Prologue offers a truly satisfying adventure. Transform dust into charm and build the pub you\u2019ve always dreamed of become the favorite spot in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.poster.avif?t=1754655239\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.webm?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.mp4?t=1754655239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD IT TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no limit to how big you can grow! Build the pub of your dreams, become the neighborhood\u2019s favorite spot, and rise as a star in the world of bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss out on this realistic pub management simulation! Add <strong><i>The Pub Life Simulator Prologue</i></strong> to your wishlist now and be among the first to play!</p>",
